message: "If you use NutriClinic in research or teaching, please cite it as below. Citation is requested; it is not an additional condition of the AGPL-3.0-only license."
type: software
title: "NutriClinic: staged nutrition recommendation"
abstract: "Staged, guideline-based nutrition recommendation for adult ICU and ward patients: feeding route, formula class by content, amount, rate or feeds, protein module, and indicated supplements with calculated doses. Missing data are listed with their effect; the recommendation becomes patient-specific as data are completed. Supports clinical decisions and does not replace them."
